stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> DRAFT: claim detected
    DRAFT --> PUBLISHED: verified + evidence pack assembled
    PUBLISHED --> CONTESTED: contest submitted
    CONTESTED --> VALIDATING: evidence validation runs
    VALIDATING --> PUBLISHED: evidence rejected (reason logged, public)
    VALIDATING --> MUTATED: evidence accepted, verdict mutates automatically
    MUTATED --> PUBLISHED: v2 published with diff
    MUTATED --> AUDIT: sampled retrospective audit (high-impact always)
    AUDIT --> PUBLISHED: audit confirms (or reverts with reason)
    PUBLISHED --> FROZEN: freeze window (5-7 Nov)
    FROZEN --> PUBLISHED: freeze lifts (after 27 Nov)